          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of
            %em Kan lift
            in a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-category"} 2-category
            or in a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bicategory"} bicategory
            is
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/duality"} dual
            to the notion of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+extension"} Kan extension
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+lifting+property"} homotopy lifting property
            is dual to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+extension+property"} homotopy extension property
            (in
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+category"} model category theory
          %p
